		"description": "<p>All mentalists flirt with psionic ability as they hone their mind alongside their body. Some take it a step further, developing real psionic power as well, blending it seamlessly with their more physical disciplines. &nbsp;You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>You gain a +1 bonus to your Intelligence score, to a maximum value of 20.</li><li>You gain proficiency with the Awakened Mind combat tradition in addition to any others you are proficient in, and immediately learn one Awakened Mind maneuver of your choice. &nbsp;You may add your esper level to your adept level to determine the maximum degree of maneuver you may learn, but only for Awakend Mind maneuvers.</li><li>You may expend a psi die and roll it, regaining exertion equal to the roll. &nbsp;Once you have done so, you may not do so again until you finish a short or long rest.</li></ul>",
